Subject: [PATCH] accel/rocket: carry SDK1 v8 lifetime, PM and error fixes

Apply after 180-rocket-pm_opp.patch. Manage IOMMU/buffer lifetimes, shared
OPP transitions and runtime PM; preserve producer fences and propagate
failed jobs to dependent work and CPU buffer preparation. Removes the
repeated pm_opp includes from the preceding downstream patch.

This is the tested essential driver, without fault-injection hooks.
Real electrical/IRQ/IOMMU hang recovery remains outside the validation.

